      "heading": "Main article",
      "text": "We will be on holiday from 24 December to 4 January. We would like to thank you for your interest and wish you a very merry Christmas, a happy New Year and – most importantly – a fantastic 2016.\n\nThe internal communications team:\n\nNorbert Staub, Florian Meyer, Isabel Nägele and Andrea Schmits"
